{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05910","headline":"偶然作六首 五 · 王维","name":"偶然作六首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赵女弹箜篌，复能邯郸舞。\n夫壻轻薄儿，鬬鸡事齐主。\n黄金买歌笑，用钱不复数。\n许史相经过，高门盈四牡。\n客舍有儒生，昂藏出邹鲁。\n读书三十年，腰间无尺组。\n被服圣人教，一生自穷苦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05910.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05910","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}